---
name: qa-bead
version: 1.5.0
description: The QA bead the lead creates when it assigns an important or minor finding (with the finding's sanity bead; `parent` = the finding's parent, since bd refuses to close a bead with an open child, `blocked_by` = that sanity bead, and `layer` and `commit` left empty until QA is dispatched), or for a Parallel Quick Fix with `quick_fix` true (its QA has no sanity check). Supply the cut layer's `branch`, `worktree`, `pr_target`, and `difficulty`; `pr_target` is the lower bound its PR base descends from. Always set `sprint_bead` from the checked bead's `metadata.sprint_bead`. It carries the close fields (close_fields.POURED); `sanity_bead` is the sanity bead imported with it, empty only for a quick fix. It is a child of `parent` (default the bead it checks) and blocks nothing. Render strictly, then `jq -c .` into the import JSONL.
format: json
required_variables:
  - id
  - checked_bead
  - sprint_bead
  - phase
  - sprint
  - stack
  - round
  - qa_member
  - reviewers_round1
  - branch
  - worktree
  - pr_target
  - stack_bead
  - checked_title
  - phase_feature
  - lint_command
  - policy_path
  - max_sanity_rounds
defaults:
  layer: ""
  commit: ""
  parent: ""
  blocked_by: ""
  priority: 2
  difficulty: normal
  quick_fix: false
  sanity_bead: ""
---
{
  "id": {{ id | tojson }},
  "title": {{ (sprint ~ ": QA round " ~ round ~ " of " ~ checked_bead) | tojson }},
  "issue_type": "task",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": {{ priority }},
  "assignee": {{ qa_member | tojson }},
  "description": {{ ("QA round " ~ round ~ " of " ~ checked_bead ~ (", layer " ~ layer ~ " of stack " ~ stack ~ ", pinned at " ~ commit ~ " on " ~ branch if commit else " on stack " ~ stack ~ ", pinned when it is dispatched") ~ ".") | tojson }},
  "acceptance_criteria": {{ ("- [ ] every reviewer ran at " ~ (commit or "the dispatched head") ~ "\n- [ ] every finding filed as a finding bead (discovered-from this bead)\n- [ ] report posted and task closed") | tojson }},
  "labels": {{ ["phase-" ~ phase, "stage:qa", "stack:" ~ stack] | tojson }},
  "dependencies": [
    {"issue_id": {{ id | tojson }}, "depends_on_id": {{ (parent or checked_bead) | tojson }}, "type": "parent-child"}{% if blocked_by %},
    {"issue_id": {{ id | tojson }}, "depends_on_id": {{ blocked_by | tojson }}, "type": "blocks"}{% endif %}
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "role": "qa",
    "stack_bead": {{ stack_bead | tojson }},
    "base": {{ pr_target | tojson }},
    "checked_title": {{ checked_title | tojson }},
    "sanity_bead": {{ sanity_bead | tojson }},
    "qa_bead": {{ id | tojson }},
    "phase_feature": {{ phase_feature | tojson }},
    "lint_command": {{ lint_command | tojson }},
    "policy_path": {{ policy_path | tojson }},
    "max_sanity_rounds": {{ max_sanity_rounds | tojson }},
    "phase": {{ phase | tojson }},
    "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
    "stack": {{ stack | tojson }},
    "layer": {{ (layer if layer != "" else none) | tojson }},
    "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
    "worktree": {{ worktree | tojson }},
    "commit": {{ (commit or none) | tojson }},
    "round": {{ round | tojson }},
    "difficulty": {{ difficulty | tojson }},
    "quick_fix": {{ quick_fix | tojson }},
    "pr_target": {% if pr_target %}{{ pr_target | tojson }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
    "checked_bead": {{ checked_bead | tojson }},
    "reviewers_round1": {{ reviewers_round1 | tojson }},
    "sprint_bead": {{ sprint_bead | tojson }}
  }
}
